I have the original paper version (October 1994) of that document and
also later revision (August 1995) of it in PDF format.  It should be
available at the same site where the firmware updates are.

However, I do not think my Alpha has ever crashed because of getting
too hot.  The case currently has three fans, one of them directed to
21066 CPU, which is of course equipped with the heatsink that came
attached to it.

> As for me, the system never drops to srm after shutdown (like other
