> had crashes even during kernel compile.

It did not matter what caused the load, but crashes were somehow
related to it.  As long as system was mostly idle, no crashes
happened.  Maybe this got fixed in later aboot or kernel versions.  It
was back in the days of Linux 2.2.15 or something.

