Frank Pawlik <Frank.Pawlik@berta.net> wrote:
> How can I compile a SRPM with CCC ?

Redefine __cc macro in your own ~/.rpmmacros, put default optimization
flags into ~/.rpmrc ("optflags: alpha ...." ; see various files in
/usr/lib/rpm ) and 'rpm --rebuild ...'.  Various spec file may
add/override some options to be gcc specific.  You will have to edit
